ont-family:'Optimistic Display',Helvetica,sans-serif; font-size:16px; font-weight:normal; line-height:1.2; margin:0; text-align:center; text-decoration:none; text-transform:none; padding:14px 32px 14px 32px; border-radius:100px; box-sizing:border-box\">Watch Live</a></div></td></tr><tr><td class=\"padding-20px-50px-40px-50px text-container\" style=\"font-size:0px; padding:20px 24px 20px 24px; word-break:break-word; text-align:left\"><div class=\"links-0068A5-underline\"><div style=\"font-family:'Optimistic Text',Helvetica,sans-serif; font-size:16px; font-weight:normal; letter-spacing:none; line-height:1.8; text-align:left; color:#1C2B33\"><p style=\"margin:0 0 0px 0\"><strong>The Meta Connect developer state of the union goes live at 10:00 AM PT.</strong> Tune in for your first look at the SDKs, toolkits and previews landing across AI, AI glasses, Meta VR and Horizon.</p></div></div></td></tr><tr><td class=\"padding-0px-50px-0px-50px img-container\" style=\"font-size:0px; padding:0px 24px 0px 24px; word-break:break-word; text-align:center\"><div style=\"margin:0 auto\"><a href=\"https://click.digital.metamail.com/?qs=ABB7InYiOjEsImQiOjUwMDl9AAoAAAAABP0IB2Rd9ykSzuUuaGN5ShJTaN1glY8Anq5XXX1KzLQ0uRRamR-piXKkiM1_fsq4P67LcWuLaoKuDJtS9JGQdbUdBaSVdM2msu7k-t9NLQ\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"text-decoration:none; color:#0068A5\"><img alt=\"Meta Connect 2026\" height=\"auto\" width=\"700\" src=\"https://client-data.knak.io/production/email_assets/5e501bf6edcaa/1mx5xwH1mJ3H2p08ad8OBWuHhe6OZiRUTkxcUNam.png?utm_source=email:6aab3005c50e2\" style=\"border:none; border-radius:24px; outline:none; text-decoration:none; height:auto; width:100%; font-size:13px; display:block\"></a></div></td></tr><tr><td class=\"padding-10px-50px-0px-50px text-container\" style=\"font-size:0px; padding:20px 24px 0px 24px; word-break:break-word; text-align:left\"><div class=\"links-0068A5-underline\"><div style=\"font-family:'Optimistic Text',Helvetica,sans-serif; font-size:16px; font-weight:normal; letter-spacing:none; line-height:1.8; text-align:left; color:#1C2B33\"><p style=\"margin:0 0 0px 0\"><br>Spend an hour going under the hood with technical experts from across Meta, including demos of the latest SDKs and toolkits along with best practices for building with them.&nbsp;</p></div></div></td></tr><tr><td class=\"padding-20px-50px-20px-50px text-container\" style=\"font-size:0px; padding:20px 24px 20px 24px; word-break:break-word; text-align:left\"><div class=\"links-0068A5-underline\"><div style=\"font-family:'Optimistic Text',Helvetica,sans-serif; font-size:16px; font-weight:normal; letter-spacing:none; line-height:1.8; text-align:left; color:#1C2B33\"><p style=\"margin:0 0 0px 0\">Developers and partners building with our latest technologies will also share their takeaways so you come away with practical insights you can start applying today.&nbsp;</p></div></div></td></tr><tr><td valign=\"middle\" class=\"padding-40px-15px-40px-0px button-container\" style=\"font-size:0px; padding:10px 0px 30px 0px; word-break:break-word; text-align:center\"><div><a href=\"https://click.digital.metamail.com/?qs=ABB7InYiOjEsImQiOjUwMDl9AAoAAAAABP0IB2RemlE2RKMMV5GvSy7FnR2haasbdrmQueN-Me2PG34acw4xtY_rg6e2OC5NAGCMJhIEzhtTFqjSWVoUhJglAbClEdX7qBb7H544JQ\" target=\"_blank\" width=\"148\" style=\"display:inline-block; width:auto; background:#0064E0; color:#ffffff; font-family:'Optimistic Display',Helvetica,sans-serif; font-size:16px; font-weight:normal; line-height:1.2; margin:0; text-align:center; text-decoration:none; text-transform:none; padding:14px 32px 14px 32px; border-radius:100px; box-sizing:border-box\">Watch Live</a></div></td></tr><tr><td class=\"img-container\" style=\"font-size:0px; padding:0px; word-break:break-word; text-align:center\"><div style=\"margin:0 auto\"><img alt=\"\" height=\"auto\" width=\"800\" src=\"https://client-data.knak.io/production/email_assets/5e501bf6edcaa/sljK6vDA1lc7TQUm7gu88mzppouK6KAwkZV0VfjU.png?utm_source=email:6aab3005c50e2\" style=\"b