  "body_text": "New SDKs, toolkits and previews across AI, AI glasses, Meta VR and Horizon.\n\n                                                    ‍͏  ͏  ‍͏  ͏  ‍͏  ͏  ‍͏  ͏  ‍͏  ͏  ‍͏  ͏  ‍͏  ͏  ‍͏  ͏  ‍͏  ͏  ‍͏  ͏  ‍͏  ͏  ‍͏  ͏  ‍͏  ͏  ‍͏  ͏  ‍͏  ͏  ‍͏  ͏  ‍͏  ͏  ‍͏  ͏  ‍͏  ͏  ‍͏  ͏  ‍͏  ͏  ‍͏  ͏  ‍͏  ͏  ‍͏  ͏  ‍͏  ͏  ‍͏  ͏  ‍͏  ͏  ‍͏  ͏  ‍͏  ͏  ‍͏  ͏  ‍͏  ͏  ‍͏  ͏  ‍͏  ͏  ‍͏  ͏  ‍͏  ͏  ‍͏  ͏  ‍͏  ͏  ‍͏  ͏  ‍͏  ͏ ͏‌ ­ ­ ­ ­ ͏‌ ­ ­ ­ ­ ͏‌ ­ ­ ­ ­ ͏‌ ­ ­ ­ ­ ͏‌ ­ ­ ­ ­ ͏‌ ­ ­ ­ ­ ͏‌ ­ ­ ­ ­ ͏‌ ­ ­ ­ ­ ͏‌ ­ ­ ­ ­ ͏‌ ­ ­ ­ ­ ͏‌ ­ ­ ­ ­ ͏‌ ­ ­ ­ ­ ͏‌ ­ ­ ­ ­ ͏‌ ­ ­ ­ ­ ͏‌ ­ ­ ­ ­ ͏‌ ­ ­ ­ ­ ͏‌ ­ ­ ­ ­ ͏‌ ­ ­ ­ ­ ͏‌ ­ ­ ­ ­ ͏‌ ­ ­ ­ ­ ͏‌ ­ ­ ­ ­ ͏‌ ­ ­ ­ ­ ͏‌ ­ ­ ­ ­ ͏‌ ­ ­ ­ ­ ͏‌ ­ ­ ­ ­ ͏‌ ­ ­ ­ ­ ͏‌ ­ ­ ­ ­ ͏‌ ­ ­ ­ ­ ͏‌ ­ ­ ­ ­ ͏‌ ­ ­ ­ ­ ͏‌ ­ ­ ­ ­ ͏‌ ­ ­ ­ ­ ͏‌ ­ ­ ­ ­ ͏‌ ­ ­ ­ ­ ͏‌ ­ ­ ­ ­ ͏‌ ­ ­ ­ ­ ͏‌ ­ ­ ­ ­ ͏‌ ­ ­ ­ ­ ͏‌ ­ ­ ­ ­ ͏‌ ­ ­ ­ ­ ͏‌ ­ ­ ­ ­ ͏‌ ­ ­ ­ ­ ͏‌ ­ ­ ­ ­ ͏‌ ­ ­ ­ ­ ͏‌ ­ ­ ­ ­ ͏‌ ­ ­ ­ ­ ͏‌ ­ ­ ­ ­ ͏‌ ­ ­ ­ ­ ͏‌ ­ ­ ­ ­ ͏‌ ­ ­ ­ ­ ͏‌ ­ ­ ­ ­ ͏‌ ­ ­ ­ ­ ͏‌ ­ ­ ­ ­ ͏‌ ­ ­ ­ ­ ͏‌ ­ ­ ­ ­ ͏‌ ­ ­ ­ ­ ͏‌ ­ ­ ­ ­ ͏‌ ­ ­ ­ ­ ͏‌ ­ ­ ­ ­ ͏‌ ­ ­ ­ ­ ͏‌ ­ ­ ­ ­ ͏‌ ­ ­ ­ ­ ͏‌ ­ ­ ­ ­ ͏‌ ­ ­ ­ ­ ͏‌ ­ ­ ­ ­\n\nDeveloper state of the union:\n\nLive today at Meta Connect\n\nWatch Live\n\nThe Meta Connect developer state of the union goes live at 10:00 AM PT. Tune in for your first look at the SDKs, toolkits and previews landing across AI, AI glasses, Meta VR and Horizon.\n\nSpend an hour going under the hood with technical experts from across Meta, including demos of the latest SDKs and toolkits along with best practices for building with them.\n\nDevelopers and partners building with our latest technologies will also share their takeaways so you come away with practical insights you can start applying today.\n\nWatch Live\n\nThis message was sent to purchasing@sesameaccess.com . If you don’t want to receive these emails from Meta in the future please unsubscribe.\n\n© 2026 Meta. Meta Platforms, Inc., 1601 Willow Rd. Menlo Park, CA 94025 or where the Meta Products are offered to you by Meta Platforms Ireland Limited, 4 Grand Canal Square, Grand Canal Harbour, Dublin 2, Ireland\n\nPlatform Policy Privacy Policy Terms Unsubscribe",
